  <summary>Chess Preparation and Database Suite</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Brett is a native chess preparation workstation and database suite for
      opening study, game review, and position analysis.
    </p>
    <p>
      It unifies local databases (.2cbh, .cbh, .si4, .pgn, .bin, .ctg, .abk,
      .bkt) with live reference sources, UCI engine evaluation, and opponent
      repertoire modeling.
    </p>
